\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Task 4 data path. Column 1 is what is stored; column 2 is how each file becomes a tensor; column 3 is how the 26 days, 70 sessions, 14 test ON sessions, 5 shared OFF references, 20-trial pool, 30-trial query, and 434 draws are batched. The callouts define the axis-averaged $R^2$, the five-seed prediction ensemble, the synthetic tone augmentation, and why every per-day figure uses the same five test days.}}{7}{figure.caption.12}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:datapipeline}{{3}{7}{Task 4 data path. Column 1 is what is stored; column 2 is how each file becomes a tensor; column 3 is how the 26 days, 70 sessions, 14 test ON sessions, 5 shared OFF references, 20-trial pool, 30-trial query, and 434 draws are batched. The callouts define the axis-averaged $R^2$, the five-seed prediction ensemble, the synthetic tone augmentation, and why every per-day figure uses the same five test days}{figure.caption.12}{}}
